---
/**
 * 02 - Companies strip. A continuous marquee of logo slots, paused on hover.
 *
 * The track is filled by the page script, which builds seven `<image-slot>` placeholders
 * and duplicates the set once so the loop is seamless. All seven await real partner logos.
 */
---

<section class="strip" aria-label="Companies hiring with CareerPassport">
  <p class="striplbl">HIRING WITH CAREERPASSPORT</p>
  <div class="track" id="logoTrack"></div>
</section>
